---
import { siteConfig } from "../../config";
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";

const accent = siteConfig.accentColor || "#1d4ed8";

const sections = [
  {
    number: "01",
    title: "Overview",
    body: [
      "Propel helps users manage benefits-related information, including EBT balance tracking and support resources. For this redesign, I focused on connecting benefits, grocery inventory, and budgeting so users could make clearer decisions around food and spending.",
      "My role included contributing to user research, identifying user needs, mapping user flows, and creating high-fidelity prototype screens that communicate the redesigned experience.",
    ],
  },
  {
    number: "02",
    title: "Problem",
    body: [
      "People who rely on EBT benefits often need to make careful decisions around grocery spending, food inventory, and upcoming deposits. However, checking a balance alone does not always help users understand what they already have at home, what food may expire soon, or how to plan purchases around their remaining benefits.",
    ],
    callout:
      "How might we help Propel users connect their benefits, grocery inventory, and spending habits so they can make more informed food and budgeting decisions?",
  },
  {
    number: "03",
    title: "User Research",
    body: [
      "Our research showed that users need more than a balance number. They need to understand what food they already have, what may expire soon, when their next deposit is coming, and how their spending affects future grocery decisions.",
    ],
  },
];

const insights = [
  [
    "Quick access matters",
    "Users need balance, deposit, and spending information upfront.",
  ],
  [
    "Food planning is connected",
    "Grocery inventory and benefits planning should not feel separate.",
  ],
  [
    "Reminders reduce waste",
    "Expiration and quantity prompts help users use what they already have.",
  ],
];

const userFlows = [
  [
    "/images/propel/user-flow-1.png",
    "User Flow 1 maps how users move from checking benefit status to finding relevant support.",
  ],
  [
    "/images/propel/user-flow-2.png",
    "User Flow 2 maps how users discover grocery savings, inventory tools, and planning features.",
  ],
];

const prototypeScreens = [
  [
    "/images/propel/home-dashboard.png",
    "Home dashboard",
    "Quick view of EBT balance, spending, deposit timeline, and grocery reminders.",
  ],
  [
    "/images/propel/spending-breakdown-chart.png",
    "Spending breakdown",
    "Helps users understand where their benefits are going across stores and categories.",
  ],
  [
    "/images/propel/inventory-overview.png",
    "Inventory overview",
    "Helps users track food they already have and what should be used soon.",
  ],
  [
    "/images/propel/grocery-planner.png",
    "Grocery planner",
    "Connects planned purchases with inventory and price information.",
  ],
];
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <title>Propel Case Study | Pamela Yung</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="A UX case study redesigning Propel into a benefits and grocery planning tool."
    />
  </head>

  <body class="bg-white text-gray-900">
    <Header />

    <main>
      <!-- HERO -->
      <section
        id="hero"
        class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-white py-24 md:h-screen"
        style={`--accent-color: ${accent}`}
      >
        <!-- Gradient overlay like Ryan's theme -->
        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 -z-10"
          style={`background: radial-gradient(ellipse 800px 1200px at 0% 0%, ${accent}40 0%, ${accent}25 20%, ${accent}10 40%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3) 70%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8) 90%, white 100%)`}
        />

        <!-- Subtle decorative grid -->
        <svg
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 size-full stroke-gray-200 [mask-image:radial-gradient(100%_100%_at_top_right,white,transparent)]"
        >
          <defs>
            <pattern
              id="grid"
              width="80"
              height="80"
              x="50%"
              y="-1"
              patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"
            >
              <path d="M.5 80V.5H80" fill="none"></path>
            </pattern>
          </defs>
          <rect width="100%" height="100%" stroke-width="0" fill="url(#grid)"></rect>
        </svg>

        <div class="h-full max-w-7xl mx-auto p-8 sm:p-12 md:p-24 flex items-center">
          <div class="max-w-6xl">
            <a
              href="/"
              class="inline-block mb-14 font-mono text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-900 transition"
            >
              ← Back to Home
            </a>

            <p
              class="font-mono text-sm sm:text-base mb-6 tracking-wide"
              style={`color: ${accent}`}
            >
              UX CASE STUDY / PRODUCT DESIGN / FIGMA
            </p>

            <h1
              class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-8xl xl:text-9xl font-bold leading-[0.9] tracking-tight text-gray-900"
            >
              Propel Benefits
              <br />
              <span style={`color: ${accent}`}>
                & Grocery Planning
              </span>
              <br />
              Redesign
            </h1>

            <p
              class="mt-10 max-w-4xl text-lg sm:text-xl md:text-2xl font-mono leading-relaxed text-gray-600"
            >
              I redesigned Propel into a benefits and grocery planning tool that helps users track EBT balance,
              monitor grocery inventory, reduce food waste, and make more informed spending decisions.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
              {["Figma", "UX Research", "Product Design", "User Flows"].map((tag) => (
                <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-white/80 border border-gray-200 text-gray-700 rounded-lg text-sm font-mono shadow-sm backdrop-blur transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-md">
                  {tag}
                </span>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-8 sm:p-12 md:p-24 flex gap-x-4 sm:gap-x-6 md:gap-x-8 text-gray-700 animate-fade-in"
        >
          <a href="#overview" class="font-mono text-sm hover:text-gray-900 transition">
            Overview
          </a>
          <a href="#research" class="font-mono text-sm hover:text-gray-900 transition">
            Research
          </a>
          <a href="#prototype" class="font-mono text-sm hover:text-gray-900 transition">
            Prototype
          </a>
          <a href="#reflection" class="font-mono text-sm hover:text-gray-900 transition">
            Reflection
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- HERO IMAGE -->
      <section class="p-8 sm:p-12 md:p-16 lg:p-24">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1">
          <img
            src="/images/propel/hero.png"
            alt="Propel app redesign screens"
            class="w-full max-w-5xl mx-auto rounded-xl border border-gray-200 transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-[1.01]"
          />
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- CONTENT SECTIONS -->
      {
        sections.map((section) => (
          <section
            id={section.title === "Overview" ? "overview" : section.title === "User Research" ? "research" : undefined}
            class="p-8 sm:p-12 md:p-16 lg:p-24"
          >
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-16 items-start">
              <div class="lg:col-span-4">
                <p class="font-mono text-sm" style={`color: ${accent}`}>
                  {section.number}
                </p>

                <h2 class="mt-2 text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-gray-900">
                  {section.title}
                </h2>

                <div
                  class="w-[75px] h-[5px] mt-4 rounded-full"
                  style={`background-color: ${accent}`}
                />
              </div>

              <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-6">
                {section.body.map((paragraph) => (
                  <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-mono leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
                    {paragraph}
                  </p>
                ))}

                {section.callout && (
                  <div class="bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 mt-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1">
                    <p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold leading-relaxed">
                      {section.callout}
                    </p>
                  </div>
                )}
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>
        ))
      }

      <!-- INSIGHTS -->
      <section class="p-8 sm:p-12 md:p-16 lg:p-24">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-16">
          <div class="lg:col-span-4">
            <p class="font-mono text-sm" style={`color: ${accent}`}>
              04
            </p>

            <h2 class="mt-2 text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold">
              Insights
            </h2>

            <div
              class="w-[75px] h-[5px] mt-4 rounded-full"
              style={`background-color: ${accent}`}
            />
          </div>

          <div class="lg:col-span-8 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            {insights.map(([title, text], index) => (
              <div class="group bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1">
                <p class="font-mono text-sm" style={`color: ${accent}`}>
                  INSIGHT 0{index + 1}
                </p>

                <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-bold group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform duration-300">
                  {title}
                </h3>

                <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                  {text}
                </p>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- USER FLOWS -->
      <section class="p-8 sm:p-12 md:p-16 lg:p-24">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-16">
          <div class="lg:col-span-4">
            <p class="font-mono text-sm" style={`color: ${accent}`}>
              05
            </p>

            <h2 class="mt-2 text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold">
              User Flows
            </h2>

            <div
              class="w-[75px] h-[5px] mt-4 rounded-full"
              style={`background-color: ${accent}`}
            />
          </div>

          <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-8">
            {userFlows.map(([src, caption]) => (
              <figure class="group bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 cursor-pointer">
                <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50">
                  <img
                    src={src}
                    alt={caption}
                    class="w-full max-h-[380px] object-contain rounded-xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-[1.02]"
                  />
                </div>

                <figcaption class="mt-4 text-sm font-mono text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                  {caption}
                </figcaption>

                <p
                  class="mt-3 font-mono text-xs opacity-0 translate-y-2 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-all duration-300"
                  style={`color: ${accent}`}
                >
                  Explore flow →
                </p>
              </figure>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- FINAL PROTOTYPE -->
      <section id="prototype" class="p-8 sm:p-12 md:p-16 lg:p-24">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-16">
          <div class="lg:col-span-4">
            <p class="font-mono text-sm" style={`color: ${accent}`}>
              06
            </p>

            <h2 class="mt-2 text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold">
              Final Prototype
            </h2>

            <div
              class="w-[75px] h-[5px] mt-4 rounded-full"
              style={`background-color: ${accent}`}
            />
          </div>

          <div class="lg:col-span-8">
            <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-mono leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
              The final prototype focuses on three connected areas: benefits tracking, grocery inventory,
              and budgeting support.
            </p>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mt-10">
              {prototypeScreens.map(([src, alt, caption]) => (
                <figure class="group bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 cursor-pointer">
                  <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 py-6">
                    <img
                      src={src}
                      alt={alt}
                      class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[245px] rounded-xl transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105"
                    />

                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gray-900/0 group-hover:bg-gray-900/5 transition duration-300"></div>
                  </div>

                  <figcaption class="mt-5 text-sm font-mono text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                    {caption}
                  </figcaption>

                  <p
                    class="mt-4 font-mono text-xs opacity-0 translate-y-2 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:translate-y-0 transition-all duration-300"
                    style={`color: ${accent}`}
                  >
                    View screen →
                  </p>
                </figure>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- REFLECTION -->
      <section id="reflection" class="p-8 sm:p-12 md:p-16 lg:p-24">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-16">
          <div class="lg:col-span-4">
            <p class="font-mono text-sm" style={`color: ${accent}`}>
              07
            </p>

            <h2 class="mt-2 text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold">
              Reflection
            </h2>

            <div
              class="w-[75px] h-[5px] mt-4 rounded-full"
              style={`background-color: ${accent}`}
            />
          </div>

          <div class="lg:col-span-8 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1">
            <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-mono leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
              This project helped me think more intentionally about how product design can reduce cognitive load.
              Benefits information can easily become overwhelming, so I focused on designing screens that help users
              quickly understand what matters and what they can do next.
            </p>

            <p class="mt-6 text-lg sm:text-xl font-mono leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
              If I continued this project, I would test the prototype with users to understand whether the dashboard,
              grocery inventory, and budgeting tools feel clear and useful in real situations.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>